    "detailed_description": "First of all , This is Classic Edition ! Online is not supported!<br><br>PICO PARK:Classic Edition is a cooperative local multiplay action puzzle game for 2-10 players.<br><br>If you want to play online, you should definitely consider this one.<br><br><br>Each level of PICO PARK can be cleared when players get the key, unlock the door and all players reach it.<br><br>But, every level requires cooperation to complete..<br>For example, players can climb on top of each other to reach new heights, or they can combine their strength to push large blocks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/ed0e0fc8733f2d245fd441e1091214cd.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br><br>PICO PARK is very flexible because every level adjusts to the total number of players.<br>So you can play with as many friends as your like..<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/f5c0b0d8a2e59aae59cf2b4081c2f193.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>2 players game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/14d512dec07be369d979121a68ab1d24.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>6 players game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/e53d83540c31b1b96198d49c28b809d2.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>10 players game<br><br>and you can control PICO PARK with your iPhone/iPad/Android.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/490bb9c42bdc81a92fd33ba286583b67.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>TecoGamePad change your smartphone turn to gamepad<br><br>iOS:<br><br>Let's have fun playing PICO PARK with your friends!",
    "about_the_game": "First of all , This is Classic Edition ! Online is not supported!<br><br>PICO PARK:Classic Edition is a cooperative local multiplay action puzzle game for 2-10 players.<br><br>If you want to play online, you should definitely consider this one.<br><br><br>Each level of PICO PARK can be cleared when players get the key, unlock the door and all players reach it.<br><br>But, every level requires cooperation to complete..<br>For example, players can climb on top of each other to reach new heights, or they can combine their strength to push large blocks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/ed0e0fc8733f2d245fd441e1091214cd.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br><br>PICO PARK is very flexible because every level adjusts to the total number of players.<br>So you can play with as many friends as your like..<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/f5c0b0d8a2e59aae59cf2b4081c2f193.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>2 players game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/14d512dec07be369d979121a68ab1d24.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>6 players game<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/e53d83540c31b1b96198d49c28b809d2.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>10 players game<br><br>and you can control PICO PARK with your iPhone/iPad/Android.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/461040/extras/490bb9c42bdc81a92fd33ba286583b67.avif?t=1740033165\" /></div><br>TecoGamePad change your smartphone turn to gamepad<br><br>iOS:<br><br>Let's have fun playing PICO PARK with your friends!",
